Z||000011||cadaver||11-14-2001||10:06 PM||||I happen to know a thing or two about headlights and conversions.<BR>No camaro lights wont fit the standard opening. They are too wide.<BR>No you cant use a DOT legal light(like a camaro) and expect it to be legal. It was approved but not for you modified application so it is no longer approved.<BR>I was going to do a slim pop up with the lights I use for my kits but I dont have any motors or stuff left laying around any more.||||reg||1
